    <description>Notifies the donor when an installment payment is marked Paid on a multi-payment commitment (Pledge / Major Gift / Grant). Sends the running totals - payment date, paid to date, remaining balance, total commitment - using one of two templates: the final-payment message when the remaining balance reaches zero, otherwise the installment message.

The send runs on the ASYNCHRONOUS (after-commit) path deliberately. A failing email inside a synchronous record-triggered flow throws CANNOT_EXECUTE_FLOW_TRIGGER and rolls back the save (proven on JSI-124 while the org-wide address is unverified). Marking a payment Paid must never fail because of email configuration - it drives deposits, reconciliation and the JSI-82 pledge stage automation. Running after commit also guarantees the roll-up summaries are final before the body is built.

Stays silent - by design - when the gift is not one of the three record types, has only one payment, is written off, or has no primary contact (common on organisational pledges). JSI-125 / Jason Ott.

Change Log:
-----------
2026-08-17 - Jason Ott - Created (JSI-125).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>formQualifies</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(
  OR({!Get_RecordType.DeveloperName} = &quot;Pledge&quot;,
     {!Get_RecordType.DeveloperName} = &quot;Major_Gift&quot;,
     {!Get_RecordType.DeveloperName} = &quot;Grant&quot;),
  {!Get_Opportunity.npe01__Number_of_Payments__c} &gt; 1,
  NOT({!$Record.npe01__Written_Off__c}),
  NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Opportunity.npsp__Primary_Contact__c}))
)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>formTemplateName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF({!Get_Opportunity.npe01__Amount_Outstanding__c} &lt;= 0, &quot;Pmt_Email_Final_Payment&quot;, &quot;Pmt_Email_Installment&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Payment Notify Donor On Paid {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Payment - Notify Donor On Paid</label>
